load @term/seed/code/number/real
  find real

# Number, the concept: the measure of quantity, built up in a tower of widening systems, the naturals (counting), the
# integers (signed counting, the unique ordered rung, the arrow of time), the rationals (fractions), the reals
# (the continuum), and then the Cayley-Dickson tower of the complex numbers, quaternions, and octonions, each doubling
# the last and shedding one law. The octonions are the final reversible rung. Every system is in the number folder, with
# the arithmetic laws and norm identities machine-checked. This concept file marks number as the first object the theory
# rests on.
form number
  link reals, like real
